  {
    "RowOffset": 1090010,
    "RowId": 19238,
    "Description": "Mirror the aetheric properties of your target, granting yourself a beneficial effect corresponding with the target's role.\nIf target is a tank, grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Tank</span>, increasing your defense and augmenting certain blue magic spells.\nIf target is a DPS, grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: DPS</span>, increasing critical hit rate and direct hit rate by 20%, as well as augmenting certain blue magic spells.\nIf target is a healer, grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Healer</span>, increasing healing magic potency by 20% and augmenting certain blue magic spells.\nCannot be cast on self. Effect ends upon reuse."
  },
  {
